            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 2,
                "height": 531,
                "renderHeight": 363.83,
                "renderWidth": 740,
                "sourceKey": "5b4e79ba7e9ae280f2798f0518efbd0ca88b1493",
                "version": 2,
                "width": 1080
              },
              "id": "YgzGgAHwHkEkDqVo",
              "type": "picture"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "ZrYLjOWTERuXOLBi",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "很多设计新手，天性都是做加法：这里加个分割线，那里加个口袋，领子换个造型，下摆再来个开衩，背后再贴图案......结果款式越改越满。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "RXWdIPtcePTgoYWK",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "tGYqiQthkWYUqoag",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "但一件衣服能承载的视觉信息是有限的，其实细节越多，视觉噪音越大，设计的语言反而越模糊。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "emZatCZzcNrfzjFN",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "VixykRdefyqgQecJ",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "我认为，减法并不是抠门，而是设计本身的需要：把多余的所谓设计创意去掉，让该表达的表达清楚。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "sbOrbuLmcfTENloR",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "NPmQNyPErlvmsfZM",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    },
                    "italic": true
                  },
                  "content": "一个细节该不该留，判断标准只有一个--- 删掉它，你原先的设计意图还在不在？",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "YhdfpcOodiWRqVRK",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 2,
                "height": 80,
                "renderHeight": 79.55,
                "renderWidth": 636.4,
                "sourceKey": "ab88d10eac757d5dd2e832954d9707559d0cea46",
                "version": 2,
                "width": 640
              },
              "id": "qWcdSXzXByykdJvx",
              "type": "picture"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "KtRWpJgMtFhHcUuF",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "从设计本身出发，我总结了4个做减法的思路。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "viLGOGzLzfmtImEo",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "思路1，结构线的减法：删掉 \"看不出为什么存在\" 的多余分割线。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "nuGZwjBKEPAZruGd",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "很多分割线其实并不是造型需要，而是类似省道转移、工艺拼缝这些版型内部的需要，被顺手做成显性的线。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "ulTeWHylSvXAZDgv",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "NykvYijwOANXTUaA",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "很多新手喜欢在服装平面上画各种各样奇奇怪怪的线（因为思维停留在二维平面上），我每次看了都很无语。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "biAsGQhWqQHZHLNT",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "KOAzLpPdRxTdvPSd",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#AB1942"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "具体的判断思路是这样：这条线删掉，版型变不变？不变，它在造型上大概率就是多余的。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "IJnSmywRQoVHmEdx",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "版型内部的省道转移留在里面处理，不该在表面刷存在感。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "tWzMUxuiIZzSPPEu",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "meDyXYckVrAEvdGE",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "真正该留的结构线，是删掉后会让比例失衡、让廓形垮掉的线，那才是设计真正关键的部分。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "GHcoKJtnGVDRcXRy",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "关于这点可以去观察迪奥经典外套对结构线的运用，它的结构线没有一条是多余的：",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "pNfXFWlvpOZyrQSw",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 2,
                "height": 783,
                "renderHeight": 536.5,
                "renderWidth": 740,
                "sourceKey": "3d347561617e39f88b9e547a73735eb792c76f0c",
                "version": 2,
                "width": 1080
              },
              "id": "MYMwAOsbRItGtLRm",
              "type": "picture"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "aiiLSkccRBHPQOBd",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "这里要注意，结构线不等于装饰线，对装饰线的运用更宽松。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "KtykyaKWCYNYZoVb",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "思路2，",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "设计焦点的减法：一个款，只留一个主设计点。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "CEGroTrfcYESSYwl",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "领型、袖子、衣身、下摆，每个部位都来一个设计点，四个点互相影响打架，穿的人肯定一个都没印象。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "MmMPSFONdhQfOdgW",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "TDCxBhCzLyKNPyyg",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#AB1942"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "出款的时候问自己：第一眼看到这件衣服，视线落在哪里？",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "AUdiTjrRwmcSokdV",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "落在超过两个地方，就是焦点失焦。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "oMetGYdmmDZjVtmW",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "ihFQnaFDqwvEJbhW",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "把主设计点定在一个部位，其他部位退回基础形态---领子是焦点，袖子就做正常袖；下摆是焦点，领口就干干净净。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "vGJtHOToHhGEwfnN",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "vgEYgLXjtuChfUWf",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "焦点只留一个，记忆点反而清晰。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "XSNMILHkpqpitqiI",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "zDUfhsPgkRlQlXOh",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "比如下面这个款，设计焦点是袖子的图案，前胸就不要画蛇添足了，很多新手设计师会犯这样的错误：",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "RYtHmEGxPGjfdIlW",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "height": 401,
                "renderHeight": 400.53,
                "renderWidth": 688.2,
                "sourceKey": "1955765ff9f8042c20ee6f9441eb25c87ffa79bc",
                "version": 2,
                "width": 689
              },
              "id": "PjnOkmwODhcLYtwj",
              "type": "picture"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "VKkkxVGKIxvnXPaf",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "思路3，",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "装饰元素的减法：一种装饰手法为主。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "llgPvfiIzlTrisDf",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "印花绣花、烫钻、压褶、拼接、撞色滚边，五个手法堆在一个款上，元素互相打架。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "DtHtgpJAGAokmaeb",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "ZJvyKFjXthZplHhc",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#AB1942"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "问自己：去掉其中某一种装饰，风格还在不在？",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "REIDlHnPCvmsRvhN",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "在，它就是多余的，装饰是风格的语言，同一种语言说一遍就够，其余的手法让位，或者用同质材料呼应。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "PvVanrrHuYHqCdGJ",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "nRzttgkMtIYScCHH",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "装饰堆得越满，越看不出设计意图，只剩 \"做得很多\"。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "qzQaBcFLPiimpScS",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "比如下面这两款，本来挺完整，但有些新手做了压褶后，又把前胸做个装饰，或者把压褶的款式上又绣花什么的，反复添加无必要的设计元素，都是画蛇添足：",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "VCOvuYjZRlspMsxv",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 2,
                "height": 676,
                "renderHeight": 463.19,
                "renderWidth": 740,
                "sourceKey": "9ad12545f6647efdbda63a3e30d5df17de9087e5",
                "version": 2,
                "width": 1080
              },
              "id": "EUrSQMDCiGGSaxKL",
              "type": "picture"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "fVYkjrMJmRjcQhyn",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "思路4，",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    },
                    "fontSize": {
                      "fontSize": 13
                    }
                  },
                  "content": "面料层次的减法：主面料之外，一两层封顶。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "IuOpEyYLVfwVdtvW",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "color": {
                      "fontColor": "#191919"
                    }
                  },
